  "officialHtml": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-sw100.html",
  "prefLabel": "Env-Sw 104.06 Permittee",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Sw 104.06 “Permittee” means a person to whom a permit to operate or construct a facility is issued pursuant to the solid waste rules or, in the case of a permit-exempt facility, the person who is responsible for construction, operation, maintenance, closure, and post-closure monitoring of the facility.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note #1 at chapter heading for Env-Sw 100) #8460-B, eff 10-28-05; ss by #14103, effective 10-23-24 (see Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Env-Sw 100)",
